Knowledge sources
-----------------
  The knowledge topics added by this edition are condensed and rewritten from
  秋起图书馆 / QIUQI LIBRARY ("Autumn Library"), a Chinese-language Hearts of Iron
  IV modding library distributed as a Steam Workshop item:

    Steam Workshop item 3445449478
    Game app id 394360 (Hearts of Iron IV)
    https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3445449478

  The library itself is a curated collection of community tutorials, templates,
  prompt sheets and tools. Where a topic relies on a specific document, the topic
  records the source path in its `source_refs` field under
  `resources/knowledge/hoi4/**`, so every claim can be traced back to the file it
  came from. No game files, no binary assets and no verbatim long-form tutorial
  text are redistributed here; the bodies are condensed English rewrites.

